      "side": 1,
      "message": "To minimize deviation from the old code, I wonder if it makes more sense to initially set this value to be `COMBINE_KEY_DELAY_MILLIS`. My main concern is that if `combineMs` isn\u0027t updated within the if statement below, the value assigned to `delayMs` will never be updated by line 250. \n\nNot sure if that messes up your new assigning logic in the for loop though. Otherwise, maybe we can add a check before line 250 that says:\n\n```\ncombineMs \u003d (combineMs \u003d\u003d Long.MAX_VALUE) ? COMBINE_KEY_DELAY_MILLIS : combineMs;\n```\n\nWhat do you think?",
